{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"leonardo-da-vinci","categoryLabel":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/35_leonardo-da-vinci/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"列奥纳多-达-芬奇-生平与时代\">列奥纳多·达·芬奇·生平与时代</h1><p>本 hub 回答一个问题：达·芬奇（1452–1519）的<strong>一生在时间与空间上究竟如何展开</strong>？我们不复述「全能天才」的颂歌，而是用可考证的档案（税单、行会名册、自荐信、合同、遗嘱）把他的生命还原为一条清晰的轨迹：芬奇镇的私生子 → 佛罗伦萨的学徒 → 米兰的宫廷工程师 → 意大利各邦的漂泊者 → 法国国王的座上宾。每个节点都标注证据等级，把可确证的事实与瓦萨里式的浪漫轶事分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的边界-vs-兄弟-hub\">本 hub 的边界（vs 兄弟 hub）</h2><p>本 hub 只回答「他何时、在何地、为谁工作、发生了什么」。其余维度交给兄弟 hub，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解</th>\n<th>去这里</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生平时间线、雇主、城市迁徙（本 hub）</td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他在绘画/科学/工程的<strong>可考证贡献</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他<strong>如何思考</strong>（观察—记录—类比的方法论）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单件作品的逐作分析（蒙娜丽莎/最后的晚餐/素描）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要作品</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他去世后<strong>作为遗产</strong>意味着什么</td>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未竟之作、神话与真伪、地位建构</td>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生平时间线总览\">生平时间线总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;  title 达·芬奇生平五段&#10;  1452-1466 : 芬奇镇早年(私生子出身)&#10;  1466-1482 : 佛罗伦萨学徒与独立画师&#10;  1482-1499 : 米兰·斯福尔扎宫廷(黄金期)&#10;  1500-1516 : 佛罗伦萨/罗马漂泊(边缘化)&#10;  1516-1519 : 法国克鲁庄园(谢幕)\">timeline\n  title 达·芬奇生平五段\n  1452-1466 : 芬奇镇早年(私生子出身)\n  1466-1482 : 佛罗伦萨学徒与独立画师\n  1482-1499 : 米兰·斯福尔扎宫廷(黄金期)\n  1500-1516 : 佛罗伦萨/罗马漂泊(边缘化)\n  1516-1519 : 法国克鲁庄园(谢幕)</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>主要身份</th>\n<th>代表事件</th>\n<th>对应文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>早年</td>\n<td>1452–1466</td>\n<td>私生子少年</td>\n<td>1457 税单确立出身</td>\n<td><a href=\"early-life/birth-in-vinci\">出生于芬奇镇</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学徒</td>\n<td>1466–1482</td>\n<td>工坊学徒/画师</td>\n<td>1472 入画家行会</td>\n<td><a href=\"early-life/apprenticeship-with-verrocchio\">师从委罗基奥</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>米兰</td>\n<td>1482–1499</td>\n<td>宫廷工程师</td>\n<td>自荐信、《最后的晚餐》</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-milan-years/serving-the-sforza\">效力斯福尔扎</a> ／ <a href=\"the-milan-years/the-mature-master\">成熟的大师</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂泊</td>\n<td>1500–1516</td>\n<td>军事工程师/画家</td>\n<td>与米开朗琪罗对决、《蒙娜丽莎》起笔</td>\n<td><a href=\"later-wanderings/florence-rome-and-rivalry\">佛罗伦萨、罗马与竞争</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法国</td>\n<td>1516–1519</td>\n<td>国王首席画家</td>\n<td>1519 去世与遗嘱</td>\n<td><a href=\"later-wanderings/final-years-in-france\">法兰西的最后岁月</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li>前置：无需专门前置知识；略知文艺复兴意大利城邦混战（米兰、佛罗伦萨、罗马）与美第奇、斯福尔扎、博尔贾等家族会更顺。</li>\n<li>顺序阅读：按时间线从「早年」读到「法国」最自然，因果链（出身 → 职业选择 → 雇主更替 → 漂泊 → 谢幕）逐段衔接。</li>\n<li>读完本 hub 后：转 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 看他「做了什么」，或转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 看他「怎么做到」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-一以贯之的立场\">本 hub 一以贯之的立场</h2><ol>\n<li>证据分级：出生日期（一手手记）、私生子身份（1457 税单）属可确证；母亲族属、出生地房舍、「国王怀中辞世」属待考或轶事，分开标注。</li>\n<li>因果优先于颂歌：私生子身份如何把他推向工坊、法国征服如何摧毁米兰黄金期，这类结构性因果比「天才自由意志」更有解释力。</li>\n<li>与兄弟 hub 不重复：贡献、方法、作品、遗产、争议各有归属，本 hub 只管时空轨迹，需要时以相对路径交叉链接。</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>阶段：</strong> 完成 | <strong>更新于：</strong> 2026-06-23</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年与学徒（1452–1482）","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/early-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-in-vinci","title":"出生于芬奇镇（1452–约1466）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/early-life/birth-in-vinci"},{"seq":2,"slug":"apprenticeship-with-verrocchio","title":"师从委罗基奥（约1466–1482）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/early-life/apprenticeship-with-verrocchio"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-milan-years","title":"米兰岁月（1482–1499）","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serving-the-sforza","title":"效力斯福尔扎（约1482–1499）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years/serving-the-sforza"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-mature-master","title":"成熟的大师（约1490s）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/the-milan-years/the-mature-master"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-wanderings","title":"晚年与漂泊（1500–1519）","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/later-wanderings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"florence-rome-and-rivalry","title":"佛罗伦萨、罗马与竞争（约1500–1516）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/later-wanderings/florence-rome-and-rivalry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years-in-france","title":"法兰西的最后岁月（1516–1519）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/life-and-times/later-wanderings/final-years-in-france"}]}]}